{"id":"837cef7baf748692","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-comb9-selective-ultrafilter.md","title":"ZFC Comb9 Selective Ultrafilter","display":"df-zfc-comb9-selective-ultrafilter — ZFC Comb9 Selective Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb9-selective-ultrafilter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb9-selective-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-zfc-comb9-selective-ultrafilter — ZFC Comb9 Selective Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb9-selective-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb9-selective-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb9-selective-ultrafilter — ZFC Comb9 Selective Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> (ultrafilter candidate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SelectiveUltrafilter}\">\\(\\operatorname{SelectiveUltrafilter}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}selective\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\operatorname{SelectiveUltrafilter}(U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land U\\cap[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}=\\varnothing\\land\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in U\\;\\Bigl((\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in A\\;(f(n)=m))\\lor\\forall m,n\\in A\\;(f(m)=f(n)\\to m=n)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}selective\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\operatorname{SelectiveUltrafilter}(U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land U\\cap[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}=\\varnothing\\land\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in U\\;\\Bigl((\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in A\\;(f(n)=m))\\lor\\forall m,n\\in A\\;(f(m)=f(n)\\to m=n)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The function characterization requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> to be constant or injective on an ultrafilter member. Nonprincipality is explicit; without it every principal ultrafilter would satisfy the displayed selection clause trivially.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$，其中 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SelectiveUltrafilter}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}selective\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\operatorname{SelectiveUltrafilter}(U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land U\\cap[\\omega]^{<\\omega}=\\varnothing\\land\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in U\\;\\Bigl((\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in A\\;(f(n)=m))\\lor\\forall m,n\\in A\\;(f(m)=f(n)\\to m=n)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1378,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1738","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-comb9-selective-ultrafilter.md|58-df-zfc-comb9-selective-ultrafilter]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}